          "type": "tab",
          "name": "More Margin",
          "settings": {
            "text_tab_label": "More Margin",
            "text_tab_heading": "Margin without extra effort",
            "textarea_tab_text": "The real margin potential in run-rate business does not lie in the top-seller itself – it lies in the attach. Every laptop sold is a gateway to several accessories that are regularly reordered. The trick lies in integrating these add-on products into the ordering process in such a way that they are automatically included – without having to be renegotiated each time."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "tab_EnGYGA": {
          "type": "tab",
          "name": "Sleeves & Cases",
          "settings": {
            "text_tab_label": "Sleeves & Cases",
            "text_tab_heading": "Sleeves & Cases",
            "textarea_tab_text": "Precisely tailored to device size and brand – simply include them as standard items in your shopping basket. No explanation needed, no tender required. Sleeves and cases are a staple in virtually every corporate IT environment. If you include them as standard extras in your range, you’ll sell them without having to actively promote them."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "tab_U46hmf": {
          "type": "tab",
          "name": "Locks & Security",
          "settings": {
            "text_tab_label": "Locks & Security",
            "text_tab_heading": "Locks & Security",
            "textarea_tab_text": "Anti-theft protection is an IT policy requirement in many companies – not an optional accessory. Locks are an essential item, particularly in environments with shared workstations, co-working spaces or field service teams. The advantage for retailers: high add-on rate, minimal need for explanation, good contribution margin."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "tab_3n6qfQ": {
          "type": "tab",
          "name": "Adapters & Connectivity",
          "settings": {
            "text_tab_label": "Adapters & Connectivity",
            "text_tab_heading": "Adapters & Connectivity",
            "textarea_tab_text": "USB-C hubs, HDMI adaptors, multi-port solutions – these items are always in demand, but rarely ordered proactively. They often end up as emergency purchases in retail outlets or on online platforms when an employee realises during their first meeting whilst working from home that they don’t have the right connector. Stocking these items in your standard product range fills this gap – and noticeably increases the order value."
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "tab_meKBEP": {
          "type": "tab",
