            "text_tab_heading": "Backpacks & Bags",
            "textarea_tab_text": "Corporate backpacks and business bags are standard items in tenders from major clients – particularly for field sales teams, consultants and hybrid workers. DICOTA offers a wide range across various price points that can be easily integrated into framework agreements."
